{#- Co-Simulation runs the network only inside fmi2DoStep, so at a
    communication point its outputs depend on none of the knowns, and
    neither do the initial unknowns in Initialization Mode:
    FMI 2.0.4, section 2.2.8: "If not present, it must be assumed that the
    `Unknown` depends on all `Knowns`. If present as empty list, the
    `Unknown` depends on none of the `Knowns`."
    An FMU that also supports Model Exchange keeps the default (no
    attribute, so all knowns), because Model Exchange outputs depend on
    the inputs. #}
{%- set dependencies = ' dependencies=""' if coSimulation and not modelExchange else '' %}


